{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/377520-hunter-help","id":377520,"title":"Hunter help.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-21T13:49:01-08:00","id":377520,"title":"Hunter help.","content":"So, I like the character sheet for the hunters hunted, but I just don't like the idea of only hunting vampires, most of the hunter abilities in the vampire source book could be brought into a hunter the reckoning game, but there are a few things I would have to change, I think I'll give the hunters the option of being kinfolk, and maybe true gypsies, but what I need help with are the spells in the source book, I was thinking of just replacing them with the paths from the sorcerer book, but I'm not sure if I should, I'd definitely give hunters the option of learning sorcerer magic, but I don't want to get rid of the hunter spells, I'd like to leave them in because I probably will still use vampires in the game, but I'm going to use more than vampires, does anyone have any suggestions on what to do about this?<br /> <br /> Thank you for your time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4786-robinkinser","name":"Robinkinser","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-01-21T14:23:51-08:00","id":377540,"title":"","content":"you could use a character sheet of Mortals and go from there<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Tec